From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:57:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] KitKat UI P33: Settings launcher icon from the 4.4 donor
 (P33.1)

The authentic android-4.4.4_r1 Settings launcher icon (settings-4.4 donor mipmap set, vendored in the CandyOS repo at reference/donor-icons/settings), byte-identical, as per-density bitmap drawables replacing the adaptive drawable/ic_launcher_settings.xml; the manifest reference (@drawable/ic_launcher_settings) picks them up unchanged. Also removes the orphaned ic_launcher_background/foreground/monochrome drawables.

Change-Id: Ibc139f8833db2a0a22d58158dd4f68f4cc68af81
